# HISTORICAL: pre-fix reproduction of the BLE Page Turner NimBLE crash.
# The crash is FIXED (plans/019 -- libbt.a IDF-host strip), so the 'expect'
# panic regex at the bottom will now TIME OUT (the panic no longer happens).
# For verification use scripts/walks/ble-page-turner-verify.walk, which asserts
# the success log line instead. Kept here only as the documented repro.
#
# Reproduce the BLE Page Turner NimBLE crash, capturing the full serial panic.
# Starts from the crash screen (CrashActivity); BACK clears it to home.
press BACK 3
# Home carousel -> drop into toolbar -> Settings (sliders) icon
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
press RIGHT 1
press RIGHT 1
press RIGHT 1
shot 01-settings-focus
# Enter Settings, advance to Net tab (CONFIRM on tab bar advances category)
press CONFIRM 2
press CONFIRM 1
press CONFIRM 1
press CONFIRM 2
shot 02-net-tab
# Move into the list: Wi-Fi Networks -> BLE Page Turner, then activate
press DOWN 1
press DOWN 1
shot 03-ble-selected
press CONFIRM 1
# Capture the panic as it prints to serial
expect 12 (assert failed|Backtrace:|Guru Meditation|npl_|panic|mutex_pend)
shot 04-ble-result
